<form action="/node/<%= host %>/<%= port %>/login" method="post" target="_blank">
  <input type="hidden" name="password" value="<%= password %>">
  <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">
    <i class="fa fa-eye"></i> Connect to GPU JupyterLab
  </button>
</form>
<p class="help-block" style="margin-top: 0.75em">
  <i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i>
  This session uses an <strong>emulated GPU</strong>. <code>nvidia-smi</code>,
  <code>nvtop</code>, <code>sbatch</code> and <code>torch.cuda</code> all work,
  but all computation runs on the CPU &mdash; timings are not GPU timings.
</p>
